{"repositoryId":1402407502,"availability":"available","full":"RejwanShafi25/RejBoard","name":"RejBoard","description":"Local-first whiteboard and note-taking app for handwritten notes, diagrams, PDF annotation and lecture voice recordings. Offline PWA and desktop app. No account, no cloud.","category":"Design","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-02T22:13:57Z","updated":"2026-10-13T02:09:15Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://rejwanshafi25.github.io/RejBoard/","topics":[],"demo":"https://rejwanshafi25.github.io/RejBoard/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T02:12:51.320Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-13T02:12:51.320Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-13T02:12:51.320Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-13T02:12:51.320Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A free, open-source, local-first whiteboard and handwriting note-taking app.","Write by hand, sketch diagrams, annotate PDFs and record lectures, with no account and no cloud. Your boards stay on your device. RejBoard runs as a desktop app (Windows, macOS, Linux) and as an installable offline web app (PWA).","I take most of my notes by hand on an Android tablet. The Android ecosystem has no shortage of handwriting apps, and each one does something well: one has an excellent pen engine, another has useful organization tools, a third handles PDFs cleverly. The problem is that the best features are usually locked behind a paywall or a subscription, and buying every app would cost far more than I was willing to spend. On top of that, most of these apps keep your notes in their own cloud."],"features":["Boards grid with thumbnails, search (titles, text, #tags), import PDF, backup/restore.","Sidebar: All notes · Favorites · Protected · Trash, then Tags and Folders. The Folders button shows your top-level folders as a grid (5×5 paging); click one to see its subfolders and boards, with a breadcrumb back.","Folders: unlimited nesting. Hover a folder card for ✎ rename, 🎨 color (swatches + custom), ＋ subfolder, 🗑 delete (contents move up one level). ＋ New folder creates a folder in the one you are viewing. Drag boards onto…","Board ⋮ menu: favorite, copy, Move board (tree picker), Edit tags, Lock with password / Remove password, Move to Trash. Locked boards show a blurred thumbnail with a lock, are listed under Protected, and ask for the…","Tags: add them from the ⋮ menu or the board header; the Tags page lists every tag and its boards (chips on cards are clickable)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RejwanShafi25/RejBoard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e4938225f4d1871dd0a9c66a5ca1b30580f8b388d0411ae65c3c311d1ed63fa3","extractedAt":"2026-10-13T02:12:51.519Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-13T02:12:51.519Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A free, open-source, local-first whiteboard and handwriting note-taking app.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RejwanShafi25/RejBoard/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Write by hand, sketch diagrams, annotate PDFs and record lectures, with no account and no cloud.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RejwanShafi25/RejBoard/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"Local-first: no account and no cloud sync.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RejwanShafi25/RejBoard/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e4938225f4d1871dd0a9c66a5ca1b30580f8b388d0411ae65c3c311d1ed63fa3","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RejwanShafi25/RejBoard/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T02:12:51.521Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-13T02:09:15Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/RejwanShafi25/RejBoard/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-13T02:12:51.524Z","hash":"e4938225f4d1871dd0a9c66a5ca1b30580f8b388d0411ae65c3c311d1ed63fa3","originalBytes":28084,"storedBytes":28084,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["text","board